---
description: Prefer CodeGraph for efficient codebase exploration
alwaysApply: true
---

When `.codegraph/` exists, use the CodeGraph MCP `codegraph_explore` tool before broad grep, directory scans, or reading multiple complete files. Treat source returned by CodeGraph as already read; do not re-read it unless the result is stale or incomplete. Read full files only when needed to make or verify an edit.
